# Runtime Plugin Storage Directory

This directory contains the runtime plugin storage for the plugin host.

## Structure
```
plugins/
├── {organization}/
│   ├── {plugin-name}@{version}/
│   │   ├── plugin-bundle.js
│   │   ├── plugin.manifest.json
│   │   ├── package.json
│   │   └── assets/
│   └── {another-plugin}@{version}/
└── .cache/
    ├── manifests/
    └── metadata/
```

## Important Notes
- This directory is managed by the plugin host runtime
- Plugins are organized by organization/namespace
- Each plugin version is stored separately
- Do not manually modify files in this directory
- The .cache directory contains runtime metadata